# ZSC 3D Fixed - U-bend Channel (Sudhakar Case 1, Re=1500)
# MaxStep
600000
# tStat, tDump, xjump
2000 10000 1
# xmin, xmax, ymin, ymax, zmin, zmax
# Auto-adjusted by code for mode 2: NX=2*a+2*Rb+2, NY=a+2, NZ computed
# Set generous values here; code will warn and adjust if needed
1 302 1 102 1 352
